<td>Employable Skills Certificate&nbsp;</td>
<td><strong>All courses from the following (19.50 units):</strong><br /><span>PEH 102 Nutrition for Fitness and Sport (4)</span><br /><span>PET 100 Introduction to Exercise Science (4)</span><br /><span>PET 101 Exercise Program Design (4)</span><br /><span>PET 102A Care and Prevention of Athletic Injuries (4)</span><br /><span>PET 103 Fitness Assessment (2)</span><br /><span>WKX 102 General Work Experience - Internship (1-5)&nbsp;(minimum 1.5 unit)</span></td>
</tr>
